OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,FWes Streeting said he has experienced
OL,8,Fmore online homophobia since becoming
OL,9,Fdefence secretary than in his entire
OL,10,Fcareer.
OL,12,FSpeaking at an event at the Edinburgh
OL,13,FFringe, Streeting said he had
OL,14,Fexperienced an "unbelievable volume"
OL,15,Fof homophobia from people who "cannot
OL,16,Fcope with the idea" of a gay defence
OL,17,Fsecretary.
OL,26,@vD@POUvD@dO]wD@_OUxD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
