OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,FWhile his appointment three weeks ago
OL,8,Fhad been "almost entirely unremarked
OL,9,Fupon in the media", he said that
OL,10,F"online it matters to a lot of people".
OL,12,FBut he said the role was an
OL,13,Fopportunity for him to show "strength"
OL,14,Fand "challenge this sort of stereotype
OL,15,Fthat clearly persists in dark corners
OL,16,Fof the internet".
OL,18,FDespite the decriminalisation of
OL,19,Fhomosexuality in 1967, it remained a
OL,20,Fcriminal offence for military
OL,21,Fpersonnel until 1994.
OL,26,@pD@JOUqD@RO]rD@AOUrD@fO]uD@]OUuD@fO]vD@
OL,26,AEOUxD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,FEven after that date, homosexuality
OL,8,Fremained classed as "conduct
OL,9,Fprejudicial to good order and
OL,10,Fdiscipline" until 2000, meaning
OL,11,Fservice personnel could still be
OL,12,Fdismissed for being gay.
OL,14,FStreeting added: "I am proud of the
OL,15,Ffact that in my lifetime we've gone
OL,16,Ffrom gay people not being allowed to
OL,17,Fserve in the military to a gay defence
OL,18,Fsecretary.
OL,26,@pD@UOUrD@KO]vD@ROU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,F"And in my first week, someone in the
OL,8,FMoD said to me, you know, as a gay
OL,9,Fman, I'm really proud that we have our
OL,10,Ffirst gay defence secretary, and it
OL,11,Fmeans a lot to many of us who remember
OL,12,Fthe bad old days."
OL,14,FPrior to his appointment, Streeting
OL,15,Fhad been considered a potential
OL,16,Fchallenger to Andy Burnham in the
OL,17,Fcontest to succeed Sir Keir Starmer.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,FBut once Starmer announced his
OL,8,Fresignation and Burnham formally
OL,9,Flaunched his bid for No 10, Streeting
OL,10,Fsaid he would not stand in the
OL,11,Fleadership contest.
OL,13,FHe told the audience in Edinburgh that
OL,14,Fhe had spoken to Burnham during the
OL,15,FMakerfield by-election campaign and
OL,16,Fdecided there were not enough
OL,17,F"fundamental differences" between the
OL,18,Ftwo men to justify standing.
OL,26,@yD@AOUyD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,F"I sort of went in with the aim of
OL,8,Fsaying I think we can show a different
OL,9,Fway of doing politics in terms of how
OL,10,Fwe debate the future of the Labour
OL,11,FParty and how we conduct ourselves in
OL,12,Fa contest," Streeting said.
OL,14,F"And we sat around over a cup of tea,
OL,15,Ftalking about what had gone wrong. And
OL,16,Finevitably, when you talk about what's
OL,17,Fgone wrong, you give hints to each
OL,18,Fother about what you think you need to
OL,19,Fdo to make it right.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@KO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,F"And the more we were talking, the
OL,8,Fmore I was thinking, how much do I
OL,9,Ffundamentally disagree with this guy
OL,10,Fon anything?"
OL,12,FStreeting said he had told Burnham he
OL,13,Fwould back him on the Friday after the
OL,14,FMakerfield by-election, and agreed to
OL,15,Fmake the announcement the following
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,FHe said he and his partner had "gone
OL,19,Finto hiding over the weekend", adding:
OL,20,F"I sort of spent three days desperate
OL,21,Fto tell people.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@MO]zD@`OU{D@]O]|D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786222095
OL,3,CWes Streeting has 'experienced more
OL,4,Chomophobia than ever in past three
OL,5,Cweeks'
OL,7,F"And the moment I did, I felt like the
OL,8,Fweight of the world had been lifted
OL,9,Foff my shoulder."
OL,11,FAsked whether he thought Burnham would
OL,12,Fbe prime minister if he had not
OL,13,Fresigned as health secretary,
OL,14,FStreeting said: "Probably not."
OL,16,FHe added: "What I think my resignation
OL,17,Fdid that week was force choices for
OL,18,Fothers."
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@QO]vD@QOUvD@_O]xD@KOUzD@HO]
